  - docs/architecture/v3-mainline-call-map.yml
  - docs/architecture/manifests/v3.provider_action_gate.mainline.yml
  required_positive:
  - Provider-local full path compiles into the unified provider error action manifest with injected provider scope while legacy action remains compatible.
  - Bounded Chat Anthropic and Responses terminal facts match once and retain exact policy identity/path through retry backoff and final projection.
  - Configured backoff is a minimum combined with provider-action-gate delay by max rather than addition.
  - Only a non-matching successful response records provider success and reaches Resp04 continuation commit.
  required_negative:
  - Id model and metadata strings cannot trigger content matching.
  - Error policy directive cannot enter normal provider/client payload MetadataCenter continuation or SSE/Server ownership.
  - Error05 cannot re-match a response-content policy from compressed error message.
  - Retry exhaustion cannot project before route/default exhaustion and cannot project more than once.
